{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日（11月25日）提醒市民，受天文大潮及東北季候風的共同影響，預料本港沿岸水位將較正常稍高，部分低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸。市民應特別留意水位變化，尤其是居住或工作於低窪地區的人士，建議提前做好防水措施以減少損失。\n</p>\n<p>天文台建議市民避免在高水位時段進行水上活動，並留意最新的天氣及潮汐資訊。如需外出，請注意道路可能因水浸而濕滑，駕駛人士應減速慢行，確保安全。</p>\n<p>天文台將持續監測情況，並適時發出進一步的天氣提示。請市民密切留意天文台的最新公告，並採取必要的防範措施。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b0%b4%e6%b5%b8%e9%a0%90%e8%ad%a6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">水浸預警</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 25 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.044728+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T16:30:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:57:52.937658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:37:50.341949+00:00","content_hash":"b95ae978c294879d4c3a52268294e8182d467406db3701e5e09539afaee92c18","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}